{"id":"n15985-1-9","stage":2,"title":"먹이 · 饲料","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n15985-1-9-1","ko":"우리 집 고양이가 먹이를 안 먹어.","zh":"我们家的猫不肯吃饭。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"우리","meaning":"我们，咱们","explanation":"우리：我们，咱们","readings":[{"term":"우리","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17182","senseId":"1","lemma":"우리","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"집","meaning":"家","explanation":"집：家","readings":[{"term":"집","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71358","senseId":"3","lemma":"집","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고양이가","meaning":"猫","explanation":"고양이：猫；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18779","senseId":"1","lemma":"고양이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹이를","meaning":"饲料，食物","explanation":"먹이：饲料，食物；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"먹이","audio":"/audio/fc4a3649c8adcb1fb5ff.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"15985","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안","meaning":"不","explanation":"안：不","readings":[{"term":"안","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71372","senseId":"1","lemma":"안","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"먹어.","meaning":"吃","explanation":"먹다：吃；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"먹다","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58272","senseId":"1","lemma":"먹다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"398dfa639dfd0db8","term":"우리","zh":"我们，咱们","audio":"/audio/398dfa639dfd0db8f8e0.mp3","entryId":"17182","definition":"说话人指代自己和听话人在内的一些人。","pronunciation":["우리"]},{"id":"99cf116bb12cf106","term":"집","zh":"家","audio":"/audio/99cf116bb12cf1061e0b.mp3","entryId":"71358","definition":"组成家庭而生活的一家子。","pronunciation":["집"]},{"id":"2c4930ad509e4bdc","term":"고양이","zh":"猫","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3","entryId":"18779","definition":"一种可以家养的小动物，在黑暗的地方也能看清事物，擅长捉老鼠。","pronunciation":["고양이"]},{"id":"fc4a3649c8adcb1f","term":"먹이","zh":"饲料，食物","audio":"/audio/fc4a3649c8adcb1fb5ff.mp3","entryId":"15985","definition":"动物为了生存须吃的东西；或指喂家畜的可供食用的东西。","pronunciation":["머기"]},{"id":"bc00bc8172c83d5f","term":"안","zh":"不","audio":"/audio/bc00bc8172c83d5fab70.mp3","entryId":"71372","definition":"表示否定或反对。","pronunciation":["안"]},{"id":"9639f892bdddb53f","term":"먹다","zh":"吃","audio":"/audio/9639f892bdddb53fc055.mp3","entryId":"58272","definition":"将食物送进口中并咽下。","pronunciation":["먹따"]}],"audio":"/audio/b52c9fc127e1c3c26409.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n15985-1-9-2","ko":"저런. 고양이 건강에 문제가 있는 거 아냐?","zh":"哎呀，难道猫的健康出问题了吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"저런.","meaning":"啊，哎呀","explanation":"저런：啊，哎呀","readings":[{"term":"저런","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71224","senseId":"1","lemma":"저런","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"고양이","meaning":"猫","explanation":"고양이：猫","readings":[{"term":"고양이","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"18779","senseId":"1","lemma":"고양이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"건강에","meaning":"健康","explanation":"건강：健康；에：格助词，表示时间、位置、去向、对象等；需结合整句理解。","readings":[{"term":"건강","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"36670","senseId":"1","lemma":"건강","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"문제가","meaning":"问题","explanation":"문제：问题；가：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"문제","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"66246","senseId":"4","lemma":"문제","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있는","meaning":"有","explanation":"있다：有；-는：将前面的动作或状态转为修饰名词的形式。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"68797","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"거","meaning":"某种事物、现象或事实。","explanation":"거：某种事物、现象或事实。","readings":[{"term":"거","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62331","senseId":"1","lemma":"거","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"아냐?","meaning":"认识","explanation":"알다：认识；냐：非敬语疑问句末，用于亲近的人、晚辈或自问。","readings":[{"term":"알다","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89445","senseId":"2","lemma":"알다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"2f66dcda6095507e","term":"저런","zh":"啊，哎呀","audio":"/audio/2f66dcda6095507e43b6.mp3","entryId":"71224","definition":"听到没料到的、惊奇或可惜的事情时说的词语。","pronunciation":["저런"]},{"id":"2c4930ad509e4bdc","term":"고양이","zh":"猫","audio":"/audio/2c4930ad509e4bdce9b3.mp3","entryId":"18779","definition":"一种可以家养的小动物，在黑暗的地方也能看清事物，擅长捉老鼠。","pronunciation":["고양이"]},{"id":"b9e697a6a3627e47","term":"건강","zh":"健康","audio":"/audio/b9e697a6a3627e47a5d1.mp3","entryId":"36670","definition":"指身体或精神没有异常、很结实的状态。","pronunciation":["건ː강"]},{"id":"bc0fca46ae9a4879","term":"문제","zh":"问题","audio":"/audio/bc0fca46ae9a48794dbd.mp3","entryId":"66246","definition":"麻烦的事情或事端。","pronunciation":["문ː제"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"有","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"68797","definition":"事实或现象存在。","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"ffcedfda7558e5dc","term":"거","zh":"某种事物、现象或事实。","audio":"/audio/ffcedfda7558e5dc31fe.mp3","entryId":"62331","definition":"某种事物、现象或事实。","pronunciation":["거"]},{"id":"4646a3463436c8a4","term":"알다","zh":"认识","audio":"/audio/4646a3463436c8a43feb.mp3","entryId":"89445","definition":"对于某个事实或情况，以意识感官来发觉到或感觉到。","pronunciation":["알ː다"]}],"audio":"/audio/1dc0801c90e5881e750d.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.208,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=15985","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":74,"sequenceScore":2.0347,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["我们家的猫不肯吃饭。","哎呀，难道